DESCRIPTION:Join us for a creative Earth Day workshop where sustainability meets style. Participants will design and build a statement pendent using thoughtfully sourced upcycled materials. Along the way\, you will learn essential jewelry making techniques and simple design principles to help your piece feel balanced and unique. Perfect for beginners and anyone who loves wearable art. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
